1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,350
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,920
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,300
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,830
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,320
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,170
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,780
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,230
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:42,430
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:45,600
It's simple.

17
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,070
We push the Lu and Rong families
toward a marriage alliance.

18
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,920
What I mean is,

19
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,110
I'll marry Rong Muxian.

20
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:55,240
No.

21
00:00:55,710 --> 00:00:57,240
Don't dismiss it so quickly.

22
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,640
Ms. Su.

23
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,240
Go on.

24
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:04,480
You don't want to kill Rong Muxian,

25
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,790
or let Lu Zhentian strike a deal
with the Rongs.

26
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,200
But you're also afraid
they won't reach an agreement,

27
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:12,040
and the treasure map may never surface.

28
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,280
So,

29
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,680
if Rong Muxian and I marry,

30
00:01:16,230 --> 00:01:17,920
our families become one.

31
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:19,640
That solves everything.

32
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:20,950
Brilliant.

33
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:22,870
With a marriage joining the families,

34
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,350
the Rongs will work with Lu Zhentian.

35
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:28,640
Lu Zhentian will surely use
the hidden gold bars.

36
00:01:28,950 --> 00:01:30,120
Exactly.

37
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:32,400
Rong Muxian and I, the Rong family's

38
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:35,010
future daughter-in-law, will surely take

39
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,280
the gold bars to Lancheng.

40
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,920
I know what you're getting at.

41
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:38,680
But...

42
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,200
still no.

43
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:44,310
Why not?

44
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:46,350
Rong Muxian hasn't even met her.

45
00:01:46,590 --> 00:01:48,640
Who can be sure he'll fall for her?

46
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:49,280
I...

47
00:01:49,330 --> 00:01:50,280
I've done my homework.

48
00:01:50,330 --> 00:01:51,400
I know what he likes.

49
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:53,200
If we play this right,

50
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,310
love at first sight could happen.

51
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,120
Staff Officer Chen.

52
00:02:01,170 --> 00:02:02,350
Do you think I'm pretty?

53
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,760
Very.

54
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,950
And you, Commander He?

55
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,030
I forgot.

56
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,910
Commander He's no ordinary man.

57
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,190
To you,

58
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,680
women are all the same.

59
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,910
Never mind what he thinks.

60
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:28,430
We're short on time.

61
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,210
We need to work out

62
00:02:30,260 --> 00:02:31,430
exactly how to pull this off.

63
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:41,760
=Episode 18=

64
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,859
♪I secretly take your♪

65
00:03:27,901 --> 00:03:30,279
♪Old hairpin and repaint it♪

66
00:03:30,321 --> 00:03:31,959
♪Imagining your smile♪

67
00:03:32,001 --> 00:03:34,170
♪Ripples stir within my heart♪

68
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,710
♪Dreaming that someday♪

69
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,980
♪I'll pin up your hair for you♪

70
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:40,710
Having second thoughts?
It's not too late.

71
00:03:40,990 --> 00:03:42,599
♪I long to take you to see♪

72
00:03:42,641 --> 00:03:44,660
♪The Qixi shadow-puppet show♪

73
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:46,370
Put my earrings on for me.

74
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:47,240
Commander He.

75
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,350
♪I'd drape a coat over your shoulders♪

76
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:53,289
♪To keep the sudden cold at bay♪

77
00:03:53,331 --> 00:03:55,529
♪The chill as rain begins to fall♪

78
00:03:55,571 --> 00:03:57,790
♪Hearing night rain on a painted boat♪

79
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:01,190
♪Where you and I first met♪

80
00:04:01,930 --> 00:04:03,939
♪How deep have these feelings grown?♪

81
00:04:03,981 --> 00:04:06,070
♪Music from the black-canopied boat♪

82
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,639
♪Deepening the sorrow of parting♪

83
00:04:09,681 --> 00:04:12,410
♪Willows turn fresh green♪

84
00:04:12,990 --> 00:04:16,440
♪The rain falls as the wind goes still♪

85
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,809
♪If I bring up the past again♪

86
00:04:18,851 --> 00:04:20,949
♪Our carefree childhood days together♪

87
00:04:20,991 --> 00:04:24,249
♪Would you mind if I called it love?♪

88
00:04:24,291 --> 00:04:27,110
♪I couldn't help but fall for you♪

89
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,630
Do I look good?

90
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:36,040
Enough to make Rong Muxian fall for me?

91
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:41,730
♪I couldn't help but fall for you♪

92
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,160
Go on.

93
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,360
Hey there.

94
00:04:57,630 --> 00:04:58,430
Watch out for the car!

95
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:01,630
Watch out!

96
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,360
Hey there.

97
00:05:11,410 --> 00:05:12,120
Are you hurt?

98
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:14,160
I'm okay.

99
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:16,600
But this lady twisted her ankle.

100
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,450
Thank you, miss.

101
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:19,240
Bye.

102
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,870
Be more careful next time.

103
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,040
Miss.

104
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:46,870
My driver was careless.

105
00:05:47,630 --> 00:05:49,120
I'll take you to the hospital at once.

106
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:50,530
Young Master.

107
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:52,160
You're visiting
the Lu Chamber of Commerce today.

108
00:05:52,210 --> 00:05:53,510
We'll be late.

109
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,480
Ms. Lu.

110
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,630
What happened?

111
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:58,630
Ms. Lu?

112
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:01,090
The governor arranged for Ms. Lu

113
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:03,000
to be your guide today.

114
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:04,720
I'm sorry.

115
00:06:04,770 --> 00:06:07,680
We'll have to tour the chamber
another day.

116
00:06:08,190 --> 00:06:09,000
That's quite all right.

117
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,070
Ms. Lu's injury comes first.

118
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,510
I'll take you to the hospital now.

119
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:17,480
We have a doctor at home.

120
00:06:17,750 --> 00:06:18,800
I'll just go home.

121
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,480
Careful.

122
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,560
Ms. Lu.

123
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,510
Forgive me for being forward.

124
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,950
Ms. Lu, hang in there.

125
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,870
Looks like Young Master Rong

126
00:06:57,270 --> 00:06:58,830
really has taken a liking to her.

127
00:06:59,190 --> 00:06:59,950
Jingchen.

128
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:01,950
Good thing you warned me yesterday.

129
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,240
Governor.

130
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:06,950
Ms. Lu had quite a fright yesterday.

131
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:10,160
She may still resent you for it.

132
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,480
For the next few days,

133
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,560
you shouldn't visit her alone.

134
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:24,090
Ms. Lu.

135
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:25,510
Stay off that foot for a few days.

136
00:07:28,750 --> 00:07:30,430
Soak it in this medicine every day

137
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:31,260
and massage it gently.

138
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:32,310
It should improve in five days.

139
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:34,310
Thank you.

140
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,560
I'll take that.

141
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:40,310
Goodbye, Ms. Lu.

142
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,630
I'm terribly sorry.

143
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,120
Young Master Rong.

144
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:53,920
Looks like Father will have to
assign you another guide.

145
00:07:54,430 --> 00:07:55,010
It's all right.

146
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:55,400
I'm in no hurry.

147
00:07:55,450 --> 00:07:56,240
I can wait.

148
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,840
(Governor's Residence)
I was careless today.

149
00:08:01,890 --> 00:08:03,040
I caused your daughter to get hurt.

150
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,240
I'm truly sorry.

151
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:06,650
Think nothing of it.

152
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:07,560
Young Master Rong.

153
00:08:07,750 --> 00:08:10,600
Perhaps you and my daughter
were meant to meet.

154
00:08:34,270 --> 00:08:35,000
Yutang.

155
00:08:35,670 --> 00:08:38,840
I was drunk that night.

156
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,360
I never should've done that.

157
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,440
I owe you an apology.

158
00:08:44,550 --> 00:08:46,510
It'll never happen again.

159
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:48,030
Just focus on recovering.

160
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,410
Once you're better,

161
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:51,960
you can go shopping
with Young Master Rong.

162
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,550
For your safety,

163
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:54,640
if anything comes up,

164
00:08:54,690 --> 00:08:55,520
or you need anything,

165
00:08:55,570 --> 00:08:56,360
go to Jingchen.

166
00:08:58,910 --> 00:08:59,720
Yes, Governor.

167
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,550
Ms. Lu.

168
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,600
The governor's been sorry all morning

169
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,720
for drinking so much last night.

170
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:07,080
As the saying goes,

171
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,910
fathers and daughters don't stay mad.

172
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:10,750
Please don't be angry anymore.

173
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:12,840
Jingchen.

174
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,270
Like I said,

175
00:09:14,550 --> 00:09:16,840
you're fully responsible
for Ms. Lu's safety now.

176
00:09:16,890 --> 00:09:17,670
Stay by her side at all times.

177
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:19,750
Yes, Governor.

178
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:28,440
You may go too.

179
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:42,320
Don't worry.

180
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:44,480
Anyone allowed to attend you closely

181
00:09:44,530 --> 00:09:45,550
is one of my people.

182
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:51,120
No need.

183
00:09:51,170 --> 00:09:51,960
I'll do it myself.

184
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,150
Feeling better?

185
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,000
Young Master Rong.

186
00:10:11,050 --> 00:10:11,840
You're here early.

187
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:15,440
Yesterday, I noticed the flowers
in Ms. Lu's room were wilting.

188
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,760
I thought seeing fresh flowers

189
00:10:17,810 --> 00:10:19,120
might help her recover faster.

190
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,150
How thoughtful of you.

191
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,910
Ms. Lu is having breakfast.

192
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:24,120
I'll take you to her.

193
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:32,080
I picked these in the garden
behind the hotel.

194
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,030
They're to brighten up your room.

195
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,480
Thank you, Young Master Rong.

196
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:40,150
By the way,

197
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,120
you're here rather early today.

198
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:43,360
Have you had breakfast?

199
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,790
I haven't either.

200
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:49,360
How about I take you to try

201
00:10:49,410 --> 00:10:51,810
Fancheng's most famous tofu buns?

202
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:52,630
Ms. Lu.

203
00:10:53,390 --> 00:10:54,720
Your ankle is still injured.

204
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:56,600
The governor said

205
00:10:56,650 --> 00:10:58,360
you should stay home and recover.

206
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,080
I'll ride in Young Master Rong's car.

207
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,360
I won't be walking.

208
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:03,550
It would be my pleasure.

209
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:08,200
All right.

210
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:12,960
I don't want you carrying me,
Commander He.

211
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,910
Your uniform is stiff and scratchy.

212
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,480
If you don't mind, Ms. Lu,

213
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:19,240
I'd be happy to carry you.

214
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,480
Young Master Rong,
you're such a gentleman.

215
00:11:56,600 --> 00:12:00,510
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

216
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:05,890
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

217
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:08,570
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

218
00:12:10,070 --> 00:12:11,620
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

219
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:15,770
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

220
00:12:16,310 --> 00:12:21,720
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

221
00:12:23,310 --> 00:12:26,620
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

222
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:29,970
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

223
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:32,530
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

224
00:12:32,580 --> 00:12:35,560
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

225
00:12:35,830 --> 00:12:42,080
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

226
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:45,870
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

227
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:49,100
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

228
00:12:49,150 --> 00:12:55,870
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

229
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:59,120
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

230
00:12:59,170 --> 00:13:02,560
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

231
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:04,730
♪Boundless♪
